    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": 2,
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你睜開眼，膝上的麒麟骰靜靜躺著。方才不論怎麼想，心裡那股亂念，總算沉了下去。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": []
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「同門這份情分，怎能說扔就扔。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      64
    ],
    "Description": "選項1：[信義]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「大師兄和他先壞了規矩，才把二師哥逼上絕路。要是換成我，寧可不要這[em2]三絕合一[/em2]，也絕不幹這種[em2]逼死同門[/em2]的勾當。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,0.05);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 65,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「那句只盼來生做兄弟……聽著真讓人心酸。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      66
    ],
    "Description": "選項2：[仁心]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 66,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「無字碑下那位前輩，到死只盼來生能做個普通兄弟……要是換成我，光是想到這句話，這拳譜再怎麼天下無敵，拿在手裡也嫌燙手。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,0.05);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 67,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「爭不到的東西，一開始就不該惦記。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      68
    ],
    "Description": "選項3：[通達]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 68,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「為了湊齊絕學把自己逼瘋，真是何苦來哉。要是換成我，這[em2]三絕合一[/em2]不要便是了，帶著自己本來的功夫下山逍遙，不比在這荒郊野外守半輩子樹強？哈哈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=15);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Meditate);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,LawChaos,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 69,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「逼死同門又把自己逼瘋，這條路也太虧了。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      70
    ],
    "Description": "選項4：[機略]"
  },
  {
    "entryID": 70,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「跟人聯手鬧出人命，又為了一本拳法把自己逼成瘋子。這盤棋怎麼算怎麼賠本。要是換成我，[em2]三絕合一[/em2]總有別的法子，犯不著把自己搭進去。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Idea);ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.05);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  }
